# {{DISPLAY_NAME}}

Minimal TSX desktop application generated by Nexa UI.

The generated dependency versions target the Desktop Technical Preview. The
`@nexa/*` packages must be published to, or available through, your configured
registry before installation; this project generator does not vendor them.

After registry access is configured:

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm doctor
pnpm typecheck
pnpm dev
pnpm build
pnpm package
```

The generated manifest denies every system permission by default. Add only the
permissions the application needs to `app.manifest.json`.
